{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Euclid</strong> is a multiplayer survival horror game that fuses <strong>PvPvE</strong> <strong>combat</strong>, <strong>realistic gunplay</strong>, <strong>resource-driven\u00a0perseverance</strong>, and <strong>psychological dread</strong> into one endless experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>abandoned research facilities</strong>, <strong>lightless monoliths</strong>, and <strong>ruins consumed by a dying world</strong>. Every encounter and every decision carries weight, to where even the smallest mistake can cost you everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lock down and fortify a base<strong>\u00a0</strong>to defend your haul, or invade others to steal what's is left. Cooperation is rare, betrayal is inevitable, and death can mean losing everything you carry.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be <strong>unforgiving and brutally challenging</strong>, <i>Euclid</i> rewards only those who adapt, think, and endure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3520000?t=1769970370","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520000/415832e628279eec70c2ecb1eab06a5649e22241/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769970370","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520000/a024ec5cb3a202e5f0664685ce05066d14e662bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769970370","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520000/a024ec5cb3a202e5f0664685ce05066d14e662bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769970370","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This game contains frequent violence and gore in a horror setting. Players and enemies can be shot, injured, and killed; blood, dismemberment, and disturbing death animations may occur. The world features strong body-horror imagery, including human forms altered with industrial/medical devices (e.g., headless bodies wearing helmets, tubing affixed to the chest). These elements are intended as unsettling, non-sexualized horror.\r\n\r\nThere are no depictions of sexual acts or sexual assault. Some enemies and environments may be intensely frightening or claustrophobic. Fictional drug/medication items may be used for gameplay effects (e.g., painkillers, stimulants), but no real-world brands or instructions are depicted."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Euclid</strong> is a multiplayer survival horror game that fuses <strong>PvPvE</strong> <strong>combat</strong>, <strong>realistic gunplay</strong>, <strong>resource-driven\u00a0perseverance</strong>, and <strong>psychological dread</strong> into one endless experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>abandoned research facilities</strong>, <strong>lightless monoliths</strong>, and <strong>ruins consumed by a dying world</strong>. Every encounter and every decision carries weight, to where even the smallest mistake can cost you everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lock down and fortify a base<strong>\u00a0</strong>to defend your haul, or invade others to steal what's is left. Cooperation is rare, betrayal is inevitable, and death can mean losing everything you carry.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be <strong>unforgiving and brutally challenging</strong>, <i>Euclid</i> rewards only those who adapt, think, and endure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["HORRIPILATION"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"de